# The repo-wide `*.nc` rule (root .gitignore:13) keeps model OUTPUT out of
# history.  The NetCDF sample here is test INPUT — the bytes the NetCDF
# golden was measured on — and a golden whose input is untracked is a
# golden that silently skips on a fresh clone, which is the exact failure
# the GLM fixture beside rw-glm already had.
!*.nc
